TEXT 0 -416 Left 2 ;Problem 4.4b - Problem 4.3 in LTspice: voice coil on a suspension (l = 3 m, B = 0.7 T, 10 g, 1 mm/N, 2 Ns/m, 5 ohm, 0.3 mH)
TEXT 0 -384 Left 2 ;TOP: mechanical IMPEDANCE analogy (force = voltage, velocity = current).   BOTTOM: mechanical MOBILITY analogy (velocity = voltage, force = current)
TEXT 0 -336 Left 2 !.param rho=1.2 c=343 S=0.01 Mmp=0.02 V=0.04 d=0.02 a={sqrt(S/pi)}
TEXT 0 -304 Left 2 !.param Ma={rho*d/S} Ca={V/(rho*c**2)} Ma1={8*rho/(3*pi**2*a)} Ra1={0.441*rho*c/S} Ra2={rho*c/S} Ca1={5.94*a**3/(rho*c**2)}
TEXT 0 -272 Left 2 !.param Re=5.0 Le=0.0003 Mm=0.01 Cm=0.001 Rm=2.0 l=3.0 B=0.7 Bl={l*B}
