TEXT 0 1456 Left 2 ;Z_E = v/i with i = 1 A: plot V(v) (impedance analogy) and V(v_m) (mobility analogy); they must be identical.  Velocity u = I(Vu) = V(u_m)
TEXT 0 1488 Left 2 ;forces: coil mass V(m1)-V(m2), suspension spring V(m2)-V(m3), damper V(m3); they add up to V(fBl) = Bl*i.  Official: peak 7.2 ohm at 51 Hz
